6ed5e12bf84b7a63069882c91dd9e9218647d17b. It is provided under Apache-2.0.
Created using Bonsai by Prism ML. Preserve its LICENSE and NOTICE.txt when
redistributing the base. The upstream notice credits Prism ML, Inc. and the
Qwen3.8-27B base from Alibaba Cloud. Shingi keeps the base unchanged and adds a
separate decision adapter.
https://huggingface.co/prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf

